_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Journal\" title=\"Journal\">Journal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Old_notes\" title=\"Old notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Book_Generic_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Old_notes\" title=\"Old notes\">Old notes</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Patient_Log:_Duke_Belynne_Stelmane\" title=\"Patient Log: Duke Belynne Stelmane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Patient_Log:_Duke_Belynne_Stelmane\" title=\"Patient Log: Duke Belynne Stelmane\">Patient Log: Duke Belynne Stelmane</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Steward_Interrogation_Log\" title=\"Shield Steward Interrogation Log\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Steward_Interrogation_Log\" title=\"Shield Steward Interrogation Log\">Shield Steward Interrogation Log</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dukes_of_Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"The Dukes of Baldur's Gate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dukes_of_Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"The Dukes of Baldur's Gate\">The Dukes of Baldur's Gate</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Stelmane_Connection\" title=\"The Stelmane Connection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Book_Parchment_K_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Stelmane_Connection\" title=\"The Stelmane Connection\">The Stelmane Connection</a></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 691.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 689.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Balduran_to_Emperor_(Stelmane).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Stelmane and her Advisor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Balduran_to_Emperor_%28Stelmane%29.png/1034px-Balduran_to_Emperor_%28Stelmane%29.png.webp, /w/images/0/06/Balduran_to_Emperor_%28Stelmane%29.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stelmane and her Advisor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Balduran_to_Emperor_%28Stelmane%29.png/1034px-Balduran_to_Emperor_%28Stelmane%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"690\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Balduran_to_Emperor_%28Stelmane%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Stelmane and her Advisor</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<ul><li>A clue to the true nature of The Emperor's relationship with Stelmane can be found in the tabletop D&amp;D adventure <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Descent_into_Avernus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate: Descent into Avernus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Descent_into_Avernus\">Baldur's Gate: Descent into Avernus</a></span>, where the segment on Stelmane describes her as fighting a secret, mental battle against a Mind Flayer possessing her. This Mind Flayer probably is the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">Emperor</a>.</li>\n<li>Data mining indicates Stellmane was originally supposed to be the abductee at Waukeen's rest instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Ulder Ravengard</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> The choice to offer the Dream Guardian a hug can be unlocked by noticing its distressed condition, accomplished by succeeding hidden <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Insight\" title=\"Insight\">Insight</a> checks which the player character cannot modify. These additional conversation options will not be available if the party first progress to <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> before long resting. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Dialogue with the Emperor in the Astral Realm, after it is rejected and distrusted </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-patientlog-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-patientlog_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-patientlog_3-1\">3.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span cl